    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCOTT FITZGERALD (SINGER)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Scott Fitzgerald, born William McPhail, is a Scottish singer and musical actor who had international success in the 1970s."</data>
